WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.534 --> 00:00:14.732
Ethan met Jason and Bobby in the hallway after school.

2
00:00:14.733 --> 00:00:18.322
"I got the invitation to your party!" Jason said.

3
00:00:18.323 --> 00:00:22.828
"Yeah, cool invitation," Bobby said.

4
00:00:22.829 --> 00:00:25.758
"I liked the sharks."

5
00:00:25.759 --> 00:00:28.894
Ethan's birthday party was this Sunday.

6
00:00:28.895 --> 00:00:33.674
He and his mom had made invitations that looked like the ocean.

7
00:00:33.675 --> 00:00:36.750
They had put little blue sharks on them.

8
00:00:36.751 --> 00:00:42.931
They had even glued real sand on the cards.

9
00:00:42.932 --> 00:00:47.243
"I'm coming to your birthday party, Ethan!" Izzie shouted.

10
00:00:47.244 --> 00:00:50.108
"Me too!" Nina said.

11
00:00:50.109 --> 00:00:52.696
Miss Shelly was setting up the table.

12
00:00:52.697 --> 00:00:56.030
Ethan felt bad for not inviting Miss Shelly.

13
00:00:56.031 --> 00:01:00.436
But no one invited teachers to birthday parties.

14
00:01:00.437 --> 00:01:05.783
"Today we're making a tasty birthday snack," Miss Shelly said.

15
00:01:05.784 --> 00:01:09.136
"We're making vanilla cupcakes!"

16
00:01:09.137 --> 00:01:13.646
"Yum! I've never made cupcakes," Izzie said.

17
00:01:13.647 --> 00:01:15.766
"Put on your aprons.

18
00:01:15.767 --> 00:01:23.718
Things might get messy!" Miss Shelly said.

19
00:01:23.719 --> 00:01:27.027
"We're going to use the hand mixer."

20
00:01:27.028 --> 00:01:30.995
"Ooh, that looks fancy," Nina said.

21
00:01:30.996 --> 00:01:34.198
"Like something a real chef has!

22
00:01:34.199 --> 00:01:36.597
How do you use it?"

23
00:01:36.598 --> 00:01:40.902
"It's easy. We put the ingredients in a bowl.

24
00:01:40.903 --> 00:01:44.888
Then we turn on the mixer," Miss Shelly explained.

25
00:01:44.889 --> 00:01:49.840
"What goes in first?" Jason asked.

26
00:01:49.841 --> 00:01:55.570
"Flour, sugar, baking powder, and salt," Ethan read.

27
00:01:55.571 --> 00:02:00.021
Nina and Izzie measured the flour and sugar.

28
00:02:00.022 --> 00:02:03.212
Jason measured the baking powder and salt.

29
00:02:03.213 --> 00:02:06.265
"Here's a whisk!" Bobby said.

30
00:02:06.266 --> 00:02:10.175
Ethan used the whisk to mix the dry ingredients.

31
00:02:10.176 --> 00:02:14.608
"I'll preheat the toaster oven," Nina said.

32
00:02:14.609 --> 00:02:17.362
"Now we need the wet ingredients.

33
00:02:17.363 --> 00:02:23.897
Butter, egg, egg yolks, vanilla, and sour cream," Jason read.

34
00:02:23.898 --> 00:02:26.929
"How do we get just egg yolks?"

35
00:02:26.930 --> 00:02:30.649
"Crack them into a bowl," Miss Shelly said.

36
00:02:30.650 --> 00:02:35.462
"And scoop up the yolk with a fork," Miss Shelly went on.

37
00:02:35.463 --> 00:02:39.689
Jason cracked two eggs into a bowl.

38
00:02:39.690 --> 00:02:46.618
Next he separated the yolks.

39
00:02:46.619 --> 00:02:49.867
"That wasn't so hard!"

40
00:02:49.868 --> 00:03:00.264
The kids added the other wet ingredients to the bowl.

41
00:03:00.265 --> 00:03:04.623
Nina poured the wet ingredients into the dry ingredients.

42
00:03:04.624 --> 00:03:11.846
They all took turns using the mixer.

43
00:03:11.847 --> 00:03:15.988
"We made cupcakes!" cried Nina.

44
00:03:15.989 --> 00:03:20.606
"Not yet! They're not baked," Miss Shelly said.

45
00:03:20.607 --> 00:03:23.873
The kids filled the baking cups with batter.

46
00:03:23.874 --> 00:03:31.015
They put the tray in the toaster oven.

47
00:03:31.016 --> 00:03:35.941
"You can't put icing on cupcakes until they cool," Miss Shelly said.

48
00:03:35.942 --> 00:03:39.614
"But I baked some cupcakes last night."

49
00:03:39.615 --> 00:03:42.884
She pulled out cupcakes from under the table.

50
00:03:42.885 --> 00:03:45.661
"We'll decorate these today."

51
00:03:45.662 --> 00:03:49.699
"Oh, those look good!" Ethan said.

52
00:03:49.700 --> 00:03:54.705
"Your mom showed me your party invitations," Miss Shelly said.

53
00:03:54.706 --> 00:03:58.278
"She did?" Ethan asked, surprised.

54
00:03:58.279 --> 00:04:02.474
"They were great!" Miss Shelly smiled.

55
00:04:02.475 --> 00:04:04.471
Ethan was relieved.

56
00:04:04.472 --> 00:04:07.955
She wasn't upset that she wasn't invited!

57
00:04:07.956 --> 00:04:13.343
"They gave me an idea," Miss Shelly continued.

58
00:04:13.344 --> 00:04:17.178
"Here is white icing and blue food coloring.

59
00:04:17.179 --> 00:04:21.057
We'll dye the icing so it looks like waves."

60
00:04:21.058 --> 00:04:23.218
She held up a bowl.

61
00:04:23.219 --> 00:04:25.854
"These are crushed graham crackers.

62
00:04:25.855 --> 00:04:29.540
They look like sand!"

63
00:04:29.541 --> 00:04:34.655
"And there are even little surfboards!" Bobby said.

64
00:04:34.656 --> 00:04:37.938
Ethan spread blue icing on his cupcake.

65
00:04:37.939 --> 00:04:41.315
He dipped half the cupcake in the graham crackers.

66
00:04:41.316 --> 00:04:46.137
Then he stuck a surfboard in the blue, sugary waves.

67
00:04:46.138 --> 00:04:53.128
It was one cool birthday cupcake!

68
00:04:53.129 --> 00:05:10.577
[caption_out@
